+### Assign a ticket: `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee`
+
+```json
+{ "assignee": "sam" }
+```
+
+`{ "assignee": null }` unassigns. An agent is a non-empty name of at most 64 characters. Answers 200 with the ticket. Only
